# Active Sampling in Evolving Neural Networks.

**Authors:** Parisi, Domenico

## Abstract
Comments on Raftopoulos article (PS 528 649) on facilitative effect of cognitive limitation in development and connectionist models. Argues that the use of neural networks within an &quot;Artificial Life&quot; perspective can more effectively contribute to the study of the role of cognitive limitations in development and their genetic basis than can using classical neural networks. (KB)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ576126

